  "nd_redis_expl": "Redistributing rewrites the other subjects' weights so the balance returns to what it was. A weight taken from the number of questions in the syllabus is data, and the app should not rewrite it unless you ask — that is why \"keep as is\" comes first.",
  "armazen_falhou": "This device would not let the app save.\n\nWhat you do from now on may not survive a reload. The most likely cause is a full storage. Save a backup now — the file works even when the internal storage does not.",
